                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6128' id='437' type-v2='text' w='84001' x='727' y='12301'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>How to Read?</run>
                    <run>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>SKUs With Location Tab(View):</run>
                    <run> It measure the depth of LBI adoption in terms of SKUs. [only for those store with &apos;LBI Started Dmarts&apos;]</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Ex: Total Dmarts globally : 1000; LBI Started Dmart: 300; </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>90% SKU Adoption would mean: 300 LBI Started dmarts has close 90% SKU adoption of LBI. [Doesnt mean 90% of all dmarts has 100% LBI SKU adoption]</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
